.agents*/
.claude*/

# Raw data: anchored to the repo root, so it never swallows src/dehyd/data/.
/data*/
logs*/
review*/
archive*/
matlab*/
paper*/

# A copied-tree revision stamp (git rev-parse HEAD > REVISION), read by provenance when
# there is no .git — e.g. IBEX, where the private repo is copied, not cloned. Never
# committed, so it can't dirty a real checkout.
/REVISION

.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.cache/
*.egg-info/

# Per-run provenance/scratch records: regenerated by every invocation.
# Curated, reported artifacts still belong in results/ and are added deliberately.
#
# Written as `results/runs/*` rather than `results/runs/` so the negation below can take:
# git cannot re-include anything whose PARENT directory is excluded.
results/runs/*

# ...except the two milestone-7 Exp A reference runs. O-M9-5 compares every later Exp A
# re-run against these, they are not regenerable (the M7-era store and environment are
# gone), and they are 244 KB. Being gitignored has already cost them twice: once to a
# wholesale sync of results/runs/, once to the IBEX tree being rebuilt. They are reference
# material, not run output, so they are version-controlled.
!results/runs/*_f36c4fb2/

# NVIDIA DCGM telemetry, dropped into the repo root by GPU jobs on IBEX. Untracked files
# count toward `git status --porcelain`, so a stray directory here makes submit_ibex.sh
# refuse to submit on a "DIRTY tree" that contains no source change at all.
dcgm/

# Transient WST job-array output: per-cell shards + fingerprint sidecars, merged into
# the committed curated CSV (results/wst/wst_diagnostics_77ghz.csv). Regenerable.
results/wst/shards/

# The sanctioned exploratory frame-split output (run_frame_split_exploratory.py). Run
# output, regenerable, and exploratory-only — it is never a reported artifact. Ignored for
# the same operational reason as dcgm/: it was sitting untracked in the IBEX tree, and an
# untracked directory counts toward `git status --porcelain`, so it made submit_ibex.sh
# refuse to submit a "DIRTY tree" that contained no source change at all.
results/exploratory_frame_split/

# The milestone-7 per-session feature store (npz + fingerprint sidecars). Large and fully
# regenerable from a clean commit by experiments/extract_features.py; never committed.
results/features/
